{"seq":1,"slug":"why-wal","title":"为何需要 WAL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations/why-wal","wordCount":1462,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何需要-wal\">为何需要 WAL</h1><p>设想一笔最普通的转账：从账户 A 扣 100，给账户 B 加 100。数据库把这两行所在的页改好放在内存缓冲池里，正准备刷回磁盘——就在写完 A 的页、还没写 B 的页时，机器断电了。重启之后，磁盘上 A 少了 100，B 却没多。钱凭空蒸发了，而数据库自己根本不知道发生过这件事。预写日志（Write-Ahead Logging, WAL）就是为了让数据库&quot;知道发生过什么&quot;而存在的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-崩溃为什么会破坏数据\">核心概念：崩溃为什么会破坏数据</h2><p>数据库不会每改一行就立刻把整页写回磁盘——那样太慢。它在内存缓冲池里攒着脏页，择机批量刷盘。这个&quot;攒&quot;的窗口正是危险所在。崩溃可能在任意时刻发生，把数据文件停在三类无法自洽的状态里：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>已提交但未落盘</strong>：事务对用户回了&quot;成功&quot;，但脏页还在内存里没写下去，断电后改动丢失——违反持久性。</li>\n<li><strong>未提交却已落盘</strong>：缓冲池为腾空间，把一个还没提交的事务的脏页提前刷了出去，断电后这半截改动赖在磁盘上——违反原子性。</li>\n<li><strong>页内撕裂</strong>：一个 8KB 的页只写进去一半就断电，页本身在物理上就是坏的。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>直接刷数据文件的根本问题是：磁盘上的数据文件<strong>既是数据又是唯一的事实</strong>，一旦它被写坏，没有任何旁证能告诉你&quot;本来应该是什么样&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wal-的核心思想-先记意图-再改数据\">WAL 的核心思想：先记意图，再改数据</h2><p>WAL 引入一条铁律——<strong>任何对数据页的修改，必须先把描述这次修改的日志记录写入持久化的日志，才能（在未来某时）把数据页本身刷盘</strong>。日志是一份追加写入、只增不改的流水账，每条记录回答&quot;谁、把哪个位置、从什么值、改成了什么值&quot;。</p>\n<p>这条规则把&quot;无法收拾的崩溃&quot;变成了&quot;可事后处理的崩溃&quot;。崩溃后系统读日志，对已提交事务<strong>重演</strong>（redo）其改动、对未提交事务<strong>撤销</strong>（undo）其改动，就能回到一致状态。两类信息的细节见<a href=\"../logging/redo-undo-logging\">redo 与 undo 日志</a>。这里的关键直觉是：<strong>日志是先于数据落地的真相</strong>，数据文件只要崩坏了，总能从日志重建。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[事务修改内存中的数据页] --&gt; B{遵守 WAL 规则}&#10;    B --&gt; C[先把日志记录写入&lt;br/&gt;持久化日志]&#10;    C --&gt; D[再允许脏页&lt;br/&gt;在未来刷盘]&#10;    D --&gt; E[崩溃发生]&#10;    E --&gt; F[重启读日志]&#10;    F --&gt; G[已提交事务&lt;br/&gt;redo 重演]&#10;    F --&gt; H[未提交事务&lt;br/&gt;undo 撤销]&#10;    G --&gt; I[回到一致状态]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[事务修改内存中的数据页] --&gt; B{遵守 WAL 规则}\n    B --&gt; C[先把日志记录写入&lt;br/&gt;持久化日志]\n    C --&gt; D[再允许脏页&lt;br/&gt;在未来刷盘]\n    D --&gt; E[崩溃发生]\n    E --&gt; F[重启读日志]\n    F --&gt; G[已提交事务&lt;br/&gt;redo 重演]\n    F --&gt; H[未提交事务&lt;br/&gt;undo 撤销]\n    G --&gt; I[回到一致状态]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"顺带白拿的性能红利\">顺带白拿的性能红利</h2><p>WAL 常被当成&quot;为了安全付出的额外开销&quot;，但它其实顺手解决了一个性能难题。数据页散布在磁盘各处，刷脏页是<strong>随机 I/O</strong>；而日志是一条<strong>顺序追加</strong>的流。机械盘上顺序写比随机写快两个数量级，即便在 NVMe SSD 上顺序写也显著更友好（更少的写放大、更规整的擦除）。</p>\n<p>WAL 让数据库可以：提交时只需把那一小段日志顺序刷盘（快），数据页的随机刷盘则推迟、合并、批量进行（慢但不在关键路径上）。一次提交从&quot;随机刷若干大页&quot;降级成&quot;顺序追加几百字节再 fsync 一次&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直接刷数据文件</th>\n<th>采用 WAL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交关键路径的 I/O</td>\n<td>随机写多个数据页</td>\n<td>顺序追加日志 + 一次 fsync</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃后可恢复性</td>\n<td>不可恢复，数据可能撕裂</td>\n<td>可 redo/undo 重建一致状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入模式</td>\n<td>随机为主</td>\n<td>提交走顺序，数据页延迟批量刷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交延迟</td>\n<td>受随机 I/O 支配</td>\n<td>受一次顺序 fsync 支配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 笔提交，直接刷盘方案的 I/O 成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rand</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times C_{\\text{rand}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rand</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rand}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为一次随机写代价），WAL 方案约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>seq</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>flush</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times C_{\\text{seq}} + \\frac{N}{k} \\times C_{\\text{flush}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flush</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中顺序写代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>seq</mtext></msub><mo>≪</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rand</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{seq}} \\ll C_{\\text{rand}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且脏页可每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 笔合并刷一次。这也正是<a href=\"../practice/group-commit-throughput\">组提交</a>能进一步把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 笔提交摊到一次 fsync 的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wal-不是万能-它的边界\">WAL 不是万能：它的边界</h2><p>WAL 解决的是<strong>崩溃一致性</strong>，它不替你解决并发正确性。两个事务同时改同一行该谁赢、读到未提交数据怎么办——那是隔离性与并发控制的范畴，属于<a href=\"../../database-transactions-concurrency/\">数据库事务与并发控制（29）</a>。WAL 也假设日志一旦 fsync 成功就真的落到了非易失介质上；如果磁盘固件撒谎（fsync 返回了但数据还在掉电易失的缓存里），WAL 的保证就被釜底抽薪——这也是数据库对存储栈 fsync 语义如此敏感的原因。</p>\n<p>此外，WAL 本身需要被持久化，它也会受页撕裂之害。如何保证一条日志记录或一个数据页的写入是原子的（要么整条生效要么完全没写），是工程实现里的硬骨头，留待<a href=\"../practice/wal-in-databases\">数据库中的 WAL</a>讲 full-page write 与双写缓冲时展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>崩溃的危险来自&quot;内存攒脏页、择机刷盘&quot;这个窗口：可能已提交未落盘（丢持久性）、未提交已落盘（丢原子性）、或页内撕裂。</li>\n<li>WAL 的铁律是&quot;改数据页前先把修改意图写入持久化日志&quot;，让日志成为先于数据的真相，崩溃后可 redo/undo 重建一致状态。</li>\n<li>它顺带把提交的关键路径从随机刷大页降级为顺序追加 + 一次 fsync，性能与安全双赢。</li>\n<li>WAL 管崩溃一致性，不管并发隔离；它的保证建立在底层存储 fsync 语义诚实的前提上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"durability-atomicity\">持久性与原子性</a>——把 WAL 要守住的两条 ACID 性质拆开细看。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../logging/redo-undo-logging\">redo 与 undo 日志</a>、<a href=\"../logging/force-steal-policies\">刷盘策略 force/steal</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../storage-engines-internals/foundations/buffer-pool\">存储引擎内幕（39）·缓冲池</a>讲清了脏页在内存里如何被管理与换出，正是 WAL 要应对的对象。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何需要 WAL","id":"为何需要-wal"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：崩溃为什么会破坏数据","id":"核心概念-崩溃为什么会破坏数据"},{"level":2,"text":"WAL 的核心思想：先记意图，再改数据","id":"wal-的核心思想-先记意图-再改数据"},{"level":2,"text":"顺带白拿的性能红利","id":"顺带白拿的性能红利"},{"level":2,"text":"WAL 不是万能：它的边界","id":"wal-不是万能-它的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"持久性与原子性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/write-ahead-logging-recovery/foundations/durability-atomicity"}}